# Failsafe network for the SoftBank Air 6: its DSA user ports are "lan" and "wan", so the mediatek default
# (ifname=lan1, set by 05_set_preinit_iface) names a port that does not exist. Runs after that hook.
air6_preinit_iface() {
	[ "$(board_name)" = "softbank,air6" ] || return 0
	ip link set eth0 up
	ifname=lan
}

boot_hook_add preinit_main air6_preinit_iface
